@host = https://localhost:7247

### user anlegen
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "TESTUSER",
  "userEmail": "testuser3@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}


### user einloggen
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}
### user einloggen
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser",
  "password": ""
}

###
GET {{host}}/api/checklists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

  ### verfaelschter Token (erwartet 401)
GET {{host}}/api/checklists
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}x